L. Document management
• Central repository for titles, registrations, licenses, contracts, inspections, receipts, invoices, insurance, accident records,
tolls/tickets, and other documents.
• Store document metadata and link files to the appropriate vehicle, driver, contract, expense, or claim.
• Enforce permissions in the document repository itself; do not rely only on hidden Access forms or links.
M. Vendors and employees
• Vendor directory with services, contact details, invoices, payments, and spending history.
• Employee roles and access managed only by authorized administrators.
N. Reports and exports
