11. Acceptance Tests Before Final Payment
• A duplicate VIN is rejected; a vehicle cannot be assigned to overlapping rentals.
• Driver and vehicle histories remain intact after reassignment or contract renewal.
• Contracts populate correctly, signed versions are preserved, and amendments are traceable.
• Revenue, payments, deposits, expenses, and balances are calculated and classified correctly.
